Description: Extracts uncertainty-aware phenological metrics (circular Day-of-Biological-Year centroids, peak timing, inactivity-aware seasonal duration, modality, onset and offset shift volumes, and Non-Overlap Area divergence) from fitted 'mgcv' Generalized Additive Models using posterior simulation.
